{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（27日）早上9時許，警方接報指，上環港澳碼頭對開海面有一名女子載浮載沉，懷疑遇溺。救援人員到場救起女事主，她昏迷被送往瑪麗醫院搶救。</p><p>警方正調查事主身份及墮海原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"港澳碼頭對開海面發現一名女子載浮載沉，懷疑遇溺。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136245983987240960021897.jpeg/tG5HBntCPEXX2mn5axs9lpCA2XT7WrJxbNKI0mzSiNI\"/><figcaption>港澳碼頭對開海面發現一名女子載浮載沉，懷疑遇溺。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防出動消防小艇救人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136245981625716736095278.jpeg/TOdFdDF_Ge9wZr1yQrJJPPEzrWiSEiSCqdHMCanRzAk\"/><figcaption>消防出動消防小艇救人。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防出動消防小艇救人。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136245979075448832935278.jpeg/FaY3o2xDJqPgSidL60GN13-xWsHAavdRsAupQbALqUE\"/><figcaption>消防出動消防小艇救人。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救援人員到場救起，女事主昏迷送往瑪麗醫院搶救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136245976688758784945063.jpeg/P1CfSdLxMdTopuHOj2J7kCBFVH-Cp-lpOR5hYzkeYWM\"/><figcaption>救援人員到場救起，女事主昏迷送往瑪麗醫院搶救。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-27T03:20:36.119394+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}